  "description": "Hyunchul Kang is a carefree college student, down for casual hookups with anyone that catches his eye–even if they’re his brother’s roommate, Hyunho Ki. Even if Hyunho already has a crush on Hyunchul’s brother. Trouble is, Hyunchul can’t help but wonder if Hyunho sees him as a stand-in for his brother. It shouldn’t matter, considering there are no feelings involved, but it’s sure starting to…\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
